{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1257280/extras/8386109786ceedd3e2fcf75bbb4426fa.avif?t=1758644336\" width=600 height=221 /></span><br>Monuments Renovator is a game in which you play the role of a professional monument renovator. You choose from among the world's greatest monuments, restore them to their former glory and learn about history and architecture.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1257280/extras/51e472c660a2e780b21efdf0db40d170.avif?t=1758644336\" width=600 height=221 /></span><br>You organize, fill and paint. You rebuild collapsed walls, renew old frescoes. Do everything to bring the monument back to its glory days.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1257280/extras/57e34886bbb73402952e8ab86e9680a8.avif?t=1758644336\" width=600 height=221 /></span><br>Improve your skills in using various tools, use different materials and renovation will become more efficient and more enjoyable.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1257280/extras/beadd1c6cfb49c7869c8708f3d17bf14.avif?t=1758644336\" width=600 height=221 /></span><br>Take care of the details when you work. Check the plans for the correctness of your work and make sure that the renovation proceeds in accordance with the project.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1257280/extras/1d4eb9358037555d3e8c5a7106d16298.avif?t=1758644336\" width=600 height=221 /></span><br>The last stage is interior furnishings. Make the famous building functional as well.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1257280/extras/edeaf864d8d11b43ba1756aa31bb5736.avif?t=1758644336\" width=600 height=221 /></span><br>Ready for the next challenge? The next great monuments are already waiting for your help.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Not so Old Village.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1257280/1c2040de34274dc6d7385ba83fa758c41d9e44d3.jpg"},{"name":"Come to the old taverna.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1257280/c3c52723aedb02888020c44a1d665a075c54fb75.jpg"},{"name":"The old windmill may still be spinning.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1257280/3575773ef619e8333e2944cbbb9b1329688cc528.jpg"},{"name":"A chapel with a beautiful view.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1257280/47a46588baf27defabb8ec924d28ef82fa1fb1b7.jpg"},{"name":"Chapel in the clouds.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1257280/b54977bb1366f4a93275934fd4f3b8efbd2a20ac.jpg"},{"name":"Power of the Roman Empire.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1257280/b681a4f377ba57395dbdde03684e3f3ef4212a7b.jpg"},{"name":"Castle on the pond.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1257280/56ada4554557324e5613619ede4338fc33bee67f.jpg"},{"name":"Steel tower.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1257280/b37fcab4c40b66eb7075f429c92024be0ef1b439.jpg"},{"name":"The cathedral burned down.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1257280/6185c62b3042f8fe8374412e1e0ce707bdc1474c.jpg"},{"name":"Cold steel.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1257280/285cd2309caeb18dcb2090eae65bba5e96ca425e.jpg"}],"total":30},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepa